      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "某月某日<br>",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:23:d7997acb",
      "source_hash": "d7997acb",
      "sequence": 1,
      "source_line": 23,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "母さんへ<br>",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:25:1406c563",
      "source_hash": "1406c563",
      "sequence": 2,
      "source_line": 25,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "なんか自分って不甲斐ないな…って思ったり。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:26:b2d5cad8",
      "source_hash": "b2d5cad8",
      "sequence": 3,
      "source_line": 26,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "フローラ様みたいな立派なお方に頼りにしてもらいたいと思うほうがおかしいのかな？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:27:f72fe282",
      "source_hash": "f72fe282",
      "sequence": 4,
      "source_line": 27,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "なんだろう…本当に何もできないのかな、僕って。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:28:f7b167cc",
      "source_hash": "f7b167cc",
      "sequence": 5,
      "source_line": 28,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "頼りになる男ってどうやってなるんだろう？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:29:af16708",
      "source_hash": "af16708",
      "sequence": 6,
      "source_line": 29,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "それって、頼りになる女とはどう違うんだろう？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:31:40c5f902",
      "source_hash": "40c5f902",
      "sequence": 7,
      "source_line": 31,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ひょっとすると、その違いこそがモテるモテないの明暗を分ける鍵だったり？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:32:87d940cf",
      "source_hash": "87d940cf",
      "sequence": 8,
      "source_line": 32,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ああいう時って、女の人はなにを求めてるんだろう…？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:33:d721d34c",
      "source_hash": "d721d34c",
      "sequence": 9,
      "source_line": 33,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "それとも何かを求めてると思うこと自体間違いなのだろうか？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:34:42d53652",
      "source_hash": "42d53652",
      "sequence": 10,
      "source_line": 34,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "そうだよね…だって、悩みを話してくれないなら、話を聞いてあげることすらできないもん。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:35:2bb0ffd",
      "source_hash": "2bb0ffd",
      "sequence": 11,
      "source_line": 35,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "無理やり聞き出したり、しつこくしたら嫌われちゃいそうだし…アプローチの仕方がわからない。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:36:f625ebe4",
      "source_hash": "f625ebe4",
      "sequence": 12,
      "source_line": 36,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "父さんはどうやって母さんに声をかけたの？ それとも、もしかしたら逆だったのかな？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:38:df6c3c47",
      "source_hash": "df6c3c47",
      "sequence": 13,
      "source_line": 38,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "なんか小っ恥ずかしいから父さんには聞けないけど…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:39:35e114e2",
      "source_hash": "35e114e2",
      "sequence": 14,
      "source_line": 39,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "セレンハイドでいることが嫌になるって…冗談気味に言っていたけど、家族の間でなにかあったのだろうか？（となると、さらに僕なんかができることなんてないけど）",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:40:70b8bfc5",
      "source_hash": "70b8bfc5",
      "sequence": 15,
      "source_line": 40,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "それとも貴族でいることになにか嫌気がさしたとか…？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:41:ea797277",
      "source_hash": "ea797277",
      "sequence": 16,
      "source_line": 41,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "ちょっと考えすぎかな…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:42:4119afad",
      "source_hash": "4119afad",
      "sequence": 17,
      "source_line": 42,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "まあ、あるよね、そんな時…いやになる時なんて誰にでも。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:44:f31cd373",
      "source_hash": "f31cd373",
      "sequence": 18,
      "source_line": 44,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "いやになるで思い出しちゃったけど…今日、お城でまたあの絵を見てしまったよ。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:45:92f3c445",
      "source_hash": "92f3c445",
      "sequence": 19,
      "source_line": 45,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "本当すごいんだよ、何度見ても圧倒されるんだ。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:46:353acd0f",
      "source_hash": "353acd0f",
      "sequence": 20,
      "source_line": 46,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "人がそこにいる、みたいな？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:47:21bae3d8",
      "source_hash": "21bae3d8",
      "sequence": 21,
      "source_line": 47,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "目を離した隙に中からセラ様が出てきてもおかしくないっていうか、もうほんとすごいんだよ！",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:48:1f7f2e2d",
      "source_hash": "1f7f2e2d",
      "sequence": 22,
      "source_line": 48,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "母さんにも見せてあげたいくらいだ。<br>",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:50:df5cbc58",
      "source_hash": "df5cbc58",
      "sequence": 23,
      "source_line": 50,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "やっぱり僕も、あんな絵を描けるようになりたい…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:52:f36da3eb",
      "source_hash": "f36da3eb",
      "sequence": 24,
      "source_line": 52,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "似たような描写をしようと毎日練習しているけど、いまいち上手くいかないんだ…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:53:92101587",
      "source_hash": "92101587",
      "sequence": 25,
      "source_line": 53,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "練習の方法が間違っているのかな…？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:54:232cfe3a",
      "source_hash": "232cfe3a",
      "sequence": 26,
      "source_line": 54,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "もうちょっと試行錯誤したほうがいいのかな…？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:55:cc9df53a",
      "source_hash": "cc9df53a",
      "sequence": 27,
      "source_line": 55,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "でも練習って…？ 試行錯誤って？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:56:b2de78e7",
      "source_hash": "b2de78e7",
      "sequence": 28,
      "source_line": 56,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "心持ちというか、目が養えてない気がするんだけど、具体的にどうわからないのかすら、わからなくなってきちゃったというか…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:57:198c0bea",
      "source_hash": "198c0bea",
      "sequence": 29,
      "source_line": 57,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "もうちょっと上達する方法を誰かに教わりたいけど、アディアさんもボランティアで教えてるだけだから、あんまり彼女に頼るのもどうかと思うのよね。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:59:34941395",
      "source_hash": "34941395",
      "sequence": 30,
      "source_line": 59,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "アトリエの人たちは全員自力で勝手に上達したらしい。本当かな？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:60:9b7c7b00",
      "source_hash": "9b7c7b00",
      "sequence": 31,
      "source_line": 60,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "根性論ってやつだろうか。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:61:86aec92b",
      "source_hash": "86aec92b",
      "sequence": 32,
      "source_line": 61,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "だったら練習してやるよ！僕だって！",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:62:244ca38a",
      "source_hash": "244ca38a",
      "sequence": 33,
      "source_line": 62,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "でも、確か…『同じことを繰り返して違う結果を期待するのは狂気の沙汰である』とか、どこかの偉人が言っていた気がするけど…誰だったっけ？",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:63:7286345b",
      "source_hash": "7286345b",
      "sequence": 34,
      "source_line": 63,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "そんな根も葉もないことを言われてしまうと、それこそ行動ができないんだけど…",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:64:cddc8742",
      "source_hash": "cddc8742",
      "sequence": 35,
      "source_line": 64,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "わからない時は本当にわからないよ…人生ってこんなものなのかね。<br>",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:66:57465e55",
      "source_hash": "57465e55",
      "sequence": 36,
      "source_line": 66,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "まあいいや。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:68:8915c15",
      "source_hash": "8915c15",
      "sequence": 37,
      "source_line": 68,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "これ以上続けても愚痴をこぼすだけになるから、今日はこのへんにしておこうと思います。",
      "required_tokens": [],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:69:3c93757b",
      "source_hash": "3c93757b",
      "sequence": 38,
      "source_line": 69,
      "speaker_id": "",
      "speaker_name": "서술/미지정",
      "voice_id": "",
      "ja": "やっと連日書くのを続けられたのにいきなり弱気なことをうじうじとごめんね。<br>",
      "required_tokens": [
        "<br>"
      ],
      "target_ko": ""
    },
    {
      "uid": "ch01-05d:71:6091fb77",
      "source_hash": "6091fb77",
      "sequence": 39,
      "source_line": 71,
